---
// Author hover cards, queried from each co-author's own Linked Data with Comunica.
//
// The script below is the only JavaScript this repository itself ships to the browser. The
// other two are third-party and inline: the analytics tag on every page, and RunKit on the
// three posts that embed a notebook.
//
// Astro does not inline it. It only inlines a `<script>` with no imports, and this one
// imports, so the built pages carry `<script type="module" src="/_astro/FoafTooltip…js">`
// — around 7 KB, 2.9 KB gzipped. With no `Cache-Control` header on the server today that
// is revalidated on every navigation.
//
// It goes on every page rather than only the ones with a bibliography: it looks for
// `a.author[resource]` and returns immediately when there is none, which is cheaper than
// deciding per layout which pages carry authors.
//
// Comunica itself is not here. `foaf-tooltip.ts` reaches it through `new Worker(...)`, so
// Vite emits it as a separate chunk that is only fetched once a reader hovers a name.
---
<script>
  import '../scripts/foaf-tooltip.ts'
</script>
